ull,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566980684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100998#issuecomment-2566980684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100998","id":2566980684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZAQRM","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-01T12:06:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-01T12:18:10Z","body":"Can confirm that it doesn't work with live editing, this is a bit of a complicated case as the exported property is a `NodePath`, so it is only loaded once on loading the scene, I forgot that editing properties in the open scene transfers to the running instance as well and not just the remote tab\n\nA workaround (or actual solution depending on if this is considered a bug or not) is to export it as a `NodePath` and get the node with `get_node`, it works though it is a bit less convenient\n\nThis quirk should probably be documented somewhere","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reaction